{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-157","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-174","text":"[&] Protocol — AmpersandBoxDesign"}]},{"id":"blk-158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-175","text":"Open, language-agnostic specification for capability composition in AI agents. Defines how agents declare memory, reasoning, time, space, body (sensorimotor), and governance capabilities that compile into MCP and A2A configurations."}]},{"id":"blk-159","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-176","text":"Implementation prompts (source-of-truth for code generation)"}]},{"id":"blk-160","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-177","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/PROTOCOL_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-178","text":" — the full implementation prompt used to generate [&] Protocol reference code. Read this before modifying the Elixir reference implementation — it contains the project identity, architecture summary, formal grammar, coding standards, and generation rules."}]}],"id":"blk-161","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-164","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-179","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/GRAPHONOMOUS_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-180","text":" — autonomous codebase traversal prompt for Graphonomous MCP integration."}]}],"id":"blk-163","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-181","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/KAPPA_BUILD_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-182","text":" — κ cyclicity detection implementation guide (v2). Canonical schema, field name rules, directed edge rules. Proved on 1,926,351 finite systems."}]}],"id":"blk-165","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-183","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/KAPPA_DELIBERATOR_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-184","text":" — deliberation loop architecture triggered by κ > 0 routing. Decompose → focus → reconcile pipeline."}]}],"id":"blk-167","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-185","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/ATTENTION_ENGINE_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-186","text":" — proactive attention engine: survey → triage → dispatch → execute → reflect. The \"ignition\" for autonomous behavior."}]}],"id":"blk-169","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-187","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/MODEL_TIER_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-188","text":" — hardware-adaptive tier budgets (local_small/8B, local_large/70B+, cloud_frontier). Same topology, different depth."}]}],"id":"blk-171","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-173","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-189","text":"Prompt dependency order:"}]},{"id":"blk-174","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"PROTOCOL_PROMPT → KAPPA_BUILD → KAPPA_DELIBERATOR → ATTENTION_ENGINE → MODEL_TIER"},{"id":"blk-175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-190","text":"These prompts serve the same role as "},{"id":"spn-191","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/"},{"id":"spn-192","text":" in other portfolio projects. When the protocol or reference impl needs changes, align with the prompt first."}]},{"id":"blk-176","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-193","text":"Build and verify (Elixir reference implementation)"}]},{"id":"blk-177","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"cd reference/elixir/ampersand_core\nmix deps.get\nmix escript.build\nmix test"},{"id":"blk-178","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-194","text":"CLI usage"}]},{"id":"blk-179","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"cd reference/elixir/ampersand_core\n./ampersand validate ../../../examples/infra-operator.ampersand.json\n./ampersand compose ../../../examples/infra-operator.ampersand.json\n./ampersand generate mcp ../../../examples/infra-operator.ampersand.json\n./ampersand generate a2a ../../../examples/infra-operator.ampersand.json"},{"id":"blk-180","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-195","text":"Repository structure"}]},{