h","spans":[{"id":"spn-228","text":"Six capability primitives: "},{"id":"spn-229","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-230","text":", "},{"id":"spn-231","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-232","text":", "},{"id":"spn-233","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-234","text":", "},{"id":"spn-235","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-236","text":", "},{"id":"spn-237","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-238","text":", "},{"id":"spn-239","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-240","text":" Two composition operators: "},{"id":"spn-241","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-242","text":" (combine) and "},{"id":"spn-243","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-244","text":" (pipeline) Capabilities are interfaces, providers are implementations. [&] does not replace MCP or A2A — it compiles into them."}]},{"id":"blk-222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-245","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-246","text":" is the sensorimotor primitive (added in draft v0.1.0) describing the agent's instantiation in an environment — perception, typed action, affordance enumeration, state encoding for replay. See OS-011 (Embodiment Protocol) for the behavioral loop that consumes "},{"id":"spn-247","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-248","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-223","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-249","text":"Schema targets"}]},{"id":"blk-224","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-250","text":"JSON Schema draft 2020-12. Prefer explicit validation rules over descriptions."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraw32blteslgrsiypohnn3ijjm4h2d7hlj2ljz3hbowlsk5btfqqxa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}